   "reason": "Independent review did not uphold this version: [{\"field\": \"savings_residuals.reason and research_rationale member check savings_check\", \"claim_says\": \"Executive Order 11541, read in full (3,633 characters), contains no saving, exception or pending-matter wording: its terms contain no words of exception, saving, continuation or pending ... (savings_check: 'read in full and has no saving or transition wording')\", \"source_says\": \"EO 11541 section 1(b) is a saving provision: 'All outstanding delegations, rules, regulations, orders, circulars, bulletins, or other forms of Executive or administrative action issued or taken by or relating to the Bureau of the Budget ... shall, until amended or revoked, remain in full force and effect as if issued or taken by or relating to the Office of Management and Budget'. It is limited to Bureau of the Budget actions and does not reach the Council for Urban Affairs, but the claim's description of the source is false.\"}, {\"field\": \"research_rationale member check scope_check\", \"claim_says\": \"Fourteen clauses are inventoried by correction ...\", \"source_says\": \"The claim inventories fifteen clauses (lead-a, b, c, sec2, sec2-1 through sec2-8, sec3, sec3-b, sec4), and the scope_check's own enumeration (title and section 1(a); 1(b); 1(c); section 2 lead; eight numbered directions; 3(a); 3(b); section 4) also totals fifteen.\"}]"
